Consumer V3 (production Account + actual local EntryPoint + software P256)
├── create with one user-owned passkey
│   ├── no mandatory activation/guardian/second key
│   └── 496k verification ceiling fails atomically (public admission unresolved)
├── spend
│   ├── self-funded complete USDC balance transfer
│   ├── sponsored creation without account ETH
│   ├── replacement paymaster requires a freshly signed operation
│   └── original paymaster unavailable -> self-funded operation still works
├── atomic batches
│   ├── checkout approval + payment -> exactly one settlement
│   ├── replay -> batch rollback, no dangling approval or second payment
│   ├── outbound burn -> scoped operation id, no remaining router allowance
│   └── CCTP checkout -> source evidence only, NOT destination settlement
└── optional backup
    ├── requires current authority plus new key possession
    ├── either consumer key may administer (1-of-N), no support authority
    ├── backup retires old key and authorizes direct exit
    └── empty/unreachable authority rejected
